Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:28.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想打赢过你还嫩了点  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have the juice to take me on,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你的能力  你越来越得心应手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,your abilities -- you're getting flabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.37,0:00:30.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  那我怎么再增强我的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,so how do I tone up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:33.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不能再这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,i'm not doing that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -我说了不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam...  - I said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.03,0:00:57.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单手切牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlier cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.57,0:00:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. you're really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:00.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是诶  好棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.34,0:01:02.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换个别的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,show us another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.87,0:01:04.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝你的饮料吧 万斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish your drink,vance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.24,0:01:07.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个简单的洗牌方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a simple riffle shuffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.02,0:01:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来个纸牌魔术吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do a card trick for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始了  超人杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh,here we go -- the incredible jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.22,0:01:17.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 这位小姐  \N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,young lady
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.77,0:01:19.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来告诉我什么时候停\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you please tell me when to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.39,0:01:20.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.09,0:01:23.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your card.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.66,0:01:25.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记住哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commit it to memory. hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是难以置信 杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's incredible,jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.53,0:01:29.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跟个混蛋一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.43,0:01:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  现在...看到你的牌了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right,now... do you see your card?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.57,0:01:34.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没  认不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um,no,i don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没  纸牌说"没"\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,the cards say "no."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:40.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-查查他的口袋 -看在上帝的份上 万斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check his pocket. for god's sake,vance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.65,0:01:44.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就看看  就看看那他妈的口袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,just check -- check the damn pocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.95,0:01:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  如果你要拿走...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,if you then would remove...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的牌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this your card?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:55.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你那么贱\N{\fnArial\fs30}why are you so mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.29,0:01:57.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么就要死盯着这位老先生呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you just leave the old guy alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.51,0:02:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他画眼线了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he wearing eyeliner?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.31,0:02:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被这荧光灯弄得眼花了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm blinded by all the sterling silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:19.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追光灯要射向我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The light has to find me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.62,0:02:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗  要射向我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it?! it -- it has to find me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:24.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}what a douche bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:25.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就不能消停一下么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,would guys give it a rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.49,0:02:26.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被你们搞得头痛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're giving me a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.62,0:02:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,come on,jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这样当然会误导我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}His misdirect is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.65,0:02:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他屁股扭得就跟第八大道上的妓女一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}shaking his ass like an 8th avenue hooker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.03,0:02:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前都是讲究技术的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to be about skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.30,0:02:33.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 从前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,used to be. used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.93,0:02:36.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听听你们俩说的话  真是可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to the you two. it's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:39.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苦唧唧的老人回想以前的光辉岁月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitter,old men talking about the glory days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.44,0:02:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么  这个傻逼不是个笑料\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? this douche bag isn't the joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:44.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.98,0:02:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说谁是笑料呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,who you calling a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:50.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  就我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me,for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:56.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那以前是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That used to be us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:58.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  也许他是个傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,maybe he is a douche bag
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.69,0:03:00.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他在主台上表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's playing the main stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们却连助理都请不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can't even afford an assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们他妈的在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.46,0:03:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们过的很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:07.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们又苦  又老\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're sad,we're old...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.57,0:03:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们都快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:15.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今晚要玩死亡魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do the table of death tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:18.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要  杰伊  别发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. no,you're not,jay. don't be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你上次试的时候差点就没命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You almost killed yourself the last time you tried it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且那是30年前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that was 30 years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:23.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我丧命了  谁在乎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,who cares if it kills me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:26.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少  我还能得个头条\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I'll go out with a headline.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.99,0:03:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.57,0:03:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你将要看到的  不是小花招也不是幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you are about to see is not a trick or an Illusion
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是胆量与技巧的显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}-- simply a display of daring and dexterity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:51.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  小姐  请检查一下封条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,young lady,if you'll please check the bindings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.74,0:03:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能发现他们很真实  很紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see they're very real,very tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:57.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:03:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以回去坐下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may take your seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.25,0:04:03.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们的确很紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn straight they're tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定你能让他们松开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you can slip them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个小时后就要开演了 万斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show's in an hour,vance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试着准时点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to be on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:05:59.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是个小花招  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a trick,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:01.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不耍小花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-i-i don't do tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是关于恶魔与天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a demonstration about demons and angels
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.45,0:06:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱情与色欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}love and lust...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:09.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a douche bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.15,0:06:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...所有这一些都在我脑海中交错的展现\N{\fnArial\fs30}...all that stuff mixed up in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是杰布·德克斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's jeb dexter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:15.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不想知道你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even want to know how you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.95,0:06:19.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很有名...之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's famous...kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:21.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为什么  因为他娘娘腔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what,douchebaggery?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管这个看起来有多扭曲  别碰我  好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}...how messed up it gets,don't touch me,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了你们的自身安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:44.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚回地狱去  恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to hell,demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:52.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的牌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this your card?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:59.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吧  装恶魔附体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,you got to be kidding me. a fake demon possession?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.13,0:07:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真不敢相信人们居然信这一套瞎话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe people actually fall for that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:06.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是瞎话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not all crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.17,0:07:08.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里哪个部分不是胡话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What part of that was not a steaming pile of b.s.?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那是谎话  但那不仅仅是魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,that was crap,but that's not all magicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.41,0:07:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是需要技巧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.01,0:07:15.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  对  我忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,right. right. I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.75,0:07:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是很喜欢这类东西  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were actually into this stuff,weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:19.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  你  你有  好像是  一副纸牌和一根魔术棒  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,you had -- you had,like,a deck of cards and a wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:22.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  那是我13岁的时候了  那是人成长的一个阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,i was 13. it was a phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是  让我起鸡皮疙瘩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just -- it bugs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.95,0:07:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  触怒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually,it offends me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.19,0:07:27.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  人们热衷于魔鬼戏法和魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,playing at demons and magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殊不知那些玩意可以让他们丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the real thing will kill you bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像某男子被10道利器刺死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a guy who drops dead of 10 stab
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外衣却完好无缺吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wounds without a single tear in his shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:34.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.07,0:07:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你老板有和谁结仇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,did your boss have any enemies that you know of?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.41,0:07:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的仇敌  多着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vance had plenty of enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:48.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他偷取别的魔术师的戏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would steal from other magicians...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:52.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一向如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都偷些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would he steal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.29,0:08:00.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舞台效果  近景技巧  能抄则抄呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stage effects,closeup techniques -- anything he could get his hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.09,0:08:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不足以造成杀人动机吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that enough to get him killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.53,0:08:03.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔术师很在意那些戏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys take this stuff pretty seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没在万斯的遗物中找到奇怪的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find anything weird in vance's stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,例如...符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...weirder?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.27,0:08:17.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  有啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matter of fact,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:27.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想  这不是万斯的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing this didn't belong to vance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.72,0:08:29.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不喜欢变卡片\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hated card tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:33.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不收集卡片  别说会藏在他的宝贝披肩里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never wanted them around,let alone in his precious cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.18,0:08:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我  你是怎么变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell me how you did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.98,0:08:57.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:08:59.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30} you know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伟大的魔术  永远无法解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great ones never give away the "how."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.15,0:09:05.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天  你还是个可怜的糟老头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday you were sad,old,and dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:07.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一眨眼就成了今天的伟大魔术师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today you're one of the great ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.56,0:09:10.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别了吧  别懵我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. this is me you're talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.66,0:09:13.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看扁我不能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think I could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:16.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,jay,i didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的朋友  挚友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my friend,my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:21.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望看到你受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-i just didn't want to see you get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:22.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.31,0:09:26.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不赖嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:39.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Not bad"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.19,0:09:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在练习如何在牌中抽出A来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working to pull an ace out of the middle of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.72,0:09:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是一张  现在我能抽出三张\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deck for years -- just one -- and now I can pull three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红心A还是没抽到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still missing the ace of hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:55.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今晚会表演"刽子手"戏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to do the executioner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.14,0:09:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这不是在引火自焚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to get yourself killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:09:58.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绳索逃生而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a rope slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.98,0:10:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,霍迪尼(著名魔术师)也不会尝试这个戏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houdini wouldn't try the executioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:02.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.98,0:10:05.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查利  想想  要是我成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it,charlie. if I can pull this off...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:08.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别太指望运气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're pushing your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.92,0:10:10.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.95,0:10:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:16.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  站这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here,stand over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.33,0:10:17.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想这样收场  查利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not end up like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一群老东西表演老掉牙的魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie -- a couple of old farts doing birthdays and bar mitzvahs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It beats dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.64,0:10:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要知道我会为你做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would do anything for you. you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:34.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不看着你送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will not watch you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.35,0:10:36.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恕难出席\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll miss that show.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.18,0:10:38.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,you'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:40.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直都来看我表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're always there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.55,0:10:43.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看你的口袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.10,0:10:53.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊 很好嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good,jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.26,0:10:54.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这招绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty damn good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:57.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查利  我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do it,charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.27,0:10:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:01.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.08,0:11:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a lame gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在个破烂酒店  表演什么大众喜爱的魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in a fleabag hotel doing this man-of-the-people crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但太阳马戏团却在维加斯表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}And freakin' angel's in vegas doing cirque du soleil!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该到那里表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should have been mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:24.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  兄弟  快点吧  我没时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,boys,get it in gear. I don't got all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是弗农·哈斯克尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You vernon haskell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:28.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.87,0:11:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤里奇联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Federal agent ulrich.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,调查帕特里克·万斯的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking into the death of patrick vance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是杰布·德克斯特  真神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm jeb dexter. this is devil twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来这里参加国际魔术师大会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're chilling at the international magicians convention,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是个好机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is a dope chance to tip my hat
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:46.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向我的前人脱帽致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the wicked cats who came before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚的表演  精彩绝伦  杰姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smokin'-hot effect last night,jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:51.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字是杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.06,0:11:55.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚点再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can loop it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:12:00.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可一世的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a douche bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't agree more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.57,0:12:07.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...有见过这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is,uh... this familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:14.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你喜欢玩塔罗牌的戏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,i heard that you used tarot cards in your act.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.45,0:12:17.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变戏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}My act?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.15,0:12:18.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咸丰年的事情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.62,0:12:20.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很多年不玩牌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't touched a deck in years,you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.19,0:12:25.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道有谁现在玩纸牌戏法的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do know someone that might use them now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.09,0:12:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布利克街上有个男的  他用纸牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,there was a guy down on bleecker street.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.99,0:12:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:32.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还在街头卖艺来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He -- he peddles that kind of specialty stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和万斯有结怨吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he have a problem with vance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  一年前  万斯和他有争吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matter of fact,vance crossed him about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.47,0:12:41.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还还他损失了5万美元现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably cost him 50 grand in royalties.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:45.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-知道他的地址吗  -布利克街426号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the exact address? 426 bleecker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.78,0:12:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说找酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask for chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:48.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.25,0:12:50.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来找酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm,uh,here to see chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.36,0:13:36.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呆在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.56,0:13:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么也别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.32,0:14:10.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚一定会让你满意的  大男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are really gonna get it tonight,big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.93,0:14:15.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有点误会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.93,0:14:18.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  想我已经有归属了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I,uh,think I've been had.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,you ain't been had...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:22.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酋长才是你的归属\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till you been had by the chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:27.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在开始之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,and before we get started...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.18,0:14:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的口令是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}...what's your safe word?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.91,0:14:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这儿干什么  露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here,ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:14:58.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我要问你的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be asking you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.91,0:15:04.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:07.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地狱火就快吞没整个世界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole world's about to be engulfed in hellfire,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.48,0:15:09.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你却在游览美国魔术城\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're in magictown,u.s.a.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.89,0:15:12.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对魔术有意见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something against magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:14.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是那34个封印没有被打破\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would almost be funny if 34 seals
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.70,0:15:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这倒是挺有意思的  34个了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}hadn't been broken already. 34,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:21.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都已经过半了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's over halfway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.77,0:15:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这场仗天使会输的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels are losing this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过一天少一天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day is one day closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:28.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果某些人不赶紧行动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if someone doesn't do something soon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:29.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某些人是指我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that someone is me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.79,0:15:31.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然还能是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else would it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.17,0:15:32.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道那些封印在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where these seals are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:34.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.25,0:15:37.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不你来告诉我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you tell me where you'd like me to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.58,0:15:39.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说你可以停止到处瞎转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,you can quit dicking around,for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.95,0:15:41.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标是大鱼  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bigger fish,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:43.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是要等封印全被打破\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if the seals are being broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才会想要追捕罪魁祸首\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to go after the one doing the breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:49.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,擒贼先擒王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the head off the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.09,0:15:53.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有你才能阻止她  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one who can stop her,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:56.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以抓紧时间干掉那个小贱人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So step up and kill the little bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.43,0:15:58.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,i'm game,believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:16:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是纠结于那个精神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the psychic thing I got a problem with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.24,0:16:02.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  我知道你在纠结什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,i know what you got a problem with
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.85,0:16:04.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是别娘门儿唧唧的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.54,0:16:06.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没别的出路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.11,0:16:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.35,0:16:11.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.98,0:16:13.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你承认自己其实喜欢这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This would all be so much easier if
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:18.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情会简单很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd just admit to yourself that you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:20.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想你从中得到的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}That feeling that it gives you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.99,0:16:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道自己在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.26,0:16:24.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,i don't,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.73,0:16:26.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很简单  路西法复活  末日来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's simple -- lucifer rises,the apocalypse starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.90,0:16:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为现在自己胜券在握么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that you have demons on your hands now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:37.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类要灭亡了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are gonna die,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:39.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成千上万的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oceans of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:42.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你想清楚了再来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,you just let me know when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:56.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发现什么好东西没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.59,0:16:57.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.63,0:16:59.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.30,0:17:00.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.83,0:17:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么让我再也不愿谈起或想起的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing I want to talk about or think about ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:08.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在犯傻  你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's crazy,and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:11.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says he can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟他好好谈过这事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you even try to talk him out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.28,0:17:15.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谈得我都精疲力竭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till I was blue in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我告诉你  佛农  他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I tell you,vernon,there was...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:20.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的眼睛里有某种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was something in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的眼睛里\N{\fnArial\fs30}"in his eyes."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩都疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're both nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:29.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酋长\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chief,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.49,0:17:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:32.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酋长不和你的胃口么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chief not your type?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:34.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以因为妨碍公务罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,i could have you both arrested
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:36.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你们两个都抓起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}for obstruction of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.23,0:17:37.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么抓  你又不是联邦调查员\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? you're no fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:39.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可是靠行骗谋生的  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We con people for a living,son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想用个假徽章来蒙我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes more than a fake badge to get past us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.18,0:17:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我投降了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.41,0:17:50.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我们  我们实际上是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,we -- we are actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:52.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个怀有明星梦的魔术师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aspiring magicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.22,0:17:52.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.39,0:17:53.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来参加这个大会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We -- we came to the convention
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:55.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为了想学点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we thought we could learn something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.79,0:17:57.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  为我们的新表演找点灵感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,get some ideas for our new show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh,what kind of show?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:18:01.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是  是一个  -一个兄弟秀  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well,it's -- it's a -- - it's a brother act. - yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:05.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你知道的  圆圈  白鸽还有  圆圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,you know,with the rings and doves and...rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.45,0:18:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们  接下来是超人杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen,I'll give you the incredible Jay
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.94,0:18:13.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想学点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to learn something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.94,0:18:16.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呆在这别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.85,0:18:18.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们  你们将要看到一场壮举\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen,what you're about to witness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.85,0:18:20.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它极度惊心动魄\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a feat so daring,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.85,0:18:24.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,极度危险  连伟大的霍迪尼也不敢挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}So dangerous,even the great houdini dared not attempt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.82,0:18:26.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我将要表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死囚逃生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The executioner!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:40.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生  正如你所见  这件束缚衣是真货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,sir,as you can see,this jacket is the real article.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:46.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  先生  请回座吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you,sir. you may take your seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:52.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我将用一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,i will have one minute
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,60秒  从不可能的险境中逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}60 seconds -- to escape certain death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:18:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们拭目以待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he's gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:03.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太精彩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! that was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.75,0:20:05.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太他妈的精彩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was freakin' amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:09.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这  不是人能办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was... not humanly possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:24.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个名叫杰伊的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like this guy jay
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在七十年代的时候名声大噪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a pretty big deal in the '70s.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说是在"魔术师大陆"  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which in Magician Land means what,exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.31,0:20:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大的足够可以做无线电音乐厅 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Big enough to play radio city music hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.91,0:20:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么让他终止了他的事业呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What got him stuck in their "where are they now?" file?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.01,0:20:35.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他年纪大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.25,0:20:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧  那也许"不可思议"的杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so maybe incredible Jay
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是用真实的魔术去创造一个"回归"\N{\fnArial\fs30}is using real magic to stage a comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说念一些咒语  然后就会死亡传送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of spell that works a death transference.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.13,0:20:49.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么这跟塔罗牌又有什么关系呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does the tarot card mix into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.40,0:20:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.91,0:20:53.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.44,0:20:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望我还没老的时候就已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope i die before i get old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这看起来很残忍  不是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whole thing seems brutal,don't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.98,0:21:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们也会么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we will?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.19,0:21:10.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.95,0:21:12.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没步入老年就已经不在人世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die before we get old.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.95,0:21:15.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道我们没准备好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't we both already?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.20,0:21:16.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我什么意思  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what i mean,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  你觉得我们还会继续猎杀恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,do you think we'll still be chasing demons
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:20.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我们六十岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we're 60?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.45,0:21:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我觉得我们之前就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,i think we'll be dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.15,0:21:23.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}For good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.02,0:21:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你想怎样结束  和特拉维斯一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? you want to end up like --like Travis?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  还是像戈登一样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}huh? or Gordon,maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.68,0:21:30.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  那是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对  肯定会有位人之楷模平静的缓缓老去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,yeah,there's a poster child for growing old gracefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.09,0:21:39.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没准我们会与众不同  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we'll be different,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走的是哪条路 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of kool-aid you drinking,man?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.68,0:21:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我们只会在血腥或是悲伤中结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy,it ends bloody or sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.34,0:21:56.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们最后胜利了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we could win?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.59,0:21:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Win"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:00.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果真有一种办法让我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there was a way we could just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.14,0:22:03.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选择一种结局的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put an end to all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.52,0:22:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么事情没告诉我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something going on  you're not telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.55,0:22:07.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No.  - Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.45,0:22:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. look,i'm st saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.88,0:22:12.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是希望我们有种办法可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish there was a way we could...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.18,0:22:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们找到根源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go after the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.44,0:22:15.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.79,0:22:18.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把源头砍掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the head off the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.24,0:22:21.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题在这个源头下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}well,the problem with the snake
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.75,0:22:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有无数个危机在等着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that it has a thousand heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.69,0:22:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些恶魔们混杂在人群中\N{\fnArial\fs30}evil bitches just keep piling out of the volkswagen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.03,0:22:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.71,0:22:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.73,0:22:38.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不去跟踪下杰伊看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't you go see if you can track down jay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.41,0:22:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会看看能在这张塔罗牌上发现点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}i'll see what i can dig up on this tarot card.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.68,0:22:55.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女仆发现杰布被吊死在天花板的吊扇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}maid found jeb hanging from the ceiling fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.33,0:22:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察认为这是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}police think it was a suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:22:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不这样认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}i beg to differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.38,0:23:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个小小的花招而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}pulled a little sleight of hand  myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.05,0:23:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用德克斯特的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}on dexter's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 所以我在想这个法术是不是一个死亡的转换\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah,so i'm thinking if this spell is a death transference,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.55,0:23:07.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么，这些卡片就像黑魔法的目标一样奏效\N{\fnArial\fs30}then these cards work like black-magic targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.15,0:23:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些受害者之间还有什么其他联系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}any connection between the victims?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.18,0:23:12.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰布昨天对杰伊大不敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}jeb was a total douche bag to jay yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那第一个受害者是谁 万斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what about the first vic?uh,vance?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.60,0:23:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我前面问了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}asked around.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.00,0:23:17.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然 万斯在酒吧问了杰伊那么多尴尬的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}apparently,vance was heckling jay at the bar
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.28,0:23:18.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当天他就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the day he was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.45,0:23:23.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 所以杰伊偷偷的塞了一张卡片进万斯的口袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay,so jay sneaks a card into vance's pocket,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.35,0:23:24.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完成这个死亡魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}does the table of death...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.69,0:23:25.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着万斯就被十支剑刺向了胸部\N{\fnArial\fs30}and vance takes 10 swords to the chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.05,0:23:29.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后杰伊在绳索逃生魔术中逃脱了 杰布却被吊死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then jay slips a noose and jeb doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.05,0:23:31.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}hell of a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.55,0:23:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们是时候找杰伊聊聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah,i think it's time we had a little chat with jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.03,0:23:34.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有啥好消息没\N{\fnArial\fs30}any luck tailing him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.33,0:23:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他甩掉了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}he slipped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.47,0:23:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经60岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's a 60-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.95,0:23:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他也是一个魔术师\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's a magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.96,0:24:06.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}up against the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.02,0:24:07.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-天啊你们是什么人 你们想要什么-别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}god,who are you?what do you want?now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.05,0:24:08.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道你一直在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}we know what you've been up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.32,0:24:11.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在使用一种很恶毒的护身符帮助你完成你的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}you been working some real bad mojo to jump-start your act.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.38,0:24:12.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.10,0:24:14.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't know what are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.27,0:24:15.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听者 我们知道你在这些塔罗牌上下了一些咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}look,we know you put a spell on those tarot cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.93,0:24:17.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和真正的魔术相结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}messing with real magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.21,0:24:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正的魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Real magic"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.12,0:24:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了吧 根本没有真正的魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}come on,there's no such thing as real magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.55,0:24:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 是的 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh,is that so?yeah,believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.84,0:24:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这一生都在干这个事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}i've been around this stuff my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.15,0:24:24.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它只不过是\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's all just --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.30,0:24:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那...那只是幻象  小把戏罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's -- it's illusions.It's tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.54,0:24:27.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那...那都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It -- it's all fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.97,0:24:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰布 德克斯特吊死了  那就只是幻想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeb Dexter strung up -- was that just an illusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.56,0:24:33.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 杰布出事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Something happened to Jeb?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.86,0:24:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他被发现吊死在自己的房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was found hanged in his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.98,0:24:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚巧就在昨晚你从绞索中逃出生天的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right after you slipped the noose last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.15,0:24:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.10,0:24:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了...让我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please...just let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.39,0:24:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.32,0:24:53.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通常这个时候他们应该向我们施些要命的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually they're whipping some badass hoodoo at us by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.45,0:24:56.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.39,0:25:01.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那么如果不是他  是谁干的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,so,if it's not him,who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.57,0:25:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算不是杰伊施的黑魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if Jay's not working the magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.68,0:25:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还是受益了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's still getting the reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.11,0:25:06.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的表演很受欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}His shows are selling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.66,0:25:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.39,0:25:10.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  不管那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,then,whoever it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.04,0:25:11.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们显然就在杰伊的小圈子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're obviously in Jay's corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.94,0:25:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  名单上还剩下佛农和查理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,so we got Vernon and Charlie on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.06,0:25:15.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.56,0:25:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们总该问问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could always ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.65,0:25:25.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该预见会发生这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we should have seen that one coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.40,0:25:27.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  他走不了太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. He couldn't have gotten that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.04,0:25:43.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没道理他从我们手中逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way he could outrun us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.95,0:25:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他消失了  我是说  他真的很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he vanished. I mean,he really is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.36,0:25:46.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又或者他找到后门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he found a back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.89,0:25:53.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.15,0:25:55.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那两个闯入我房间的混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are the two nut jobs that just broke into my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.15,0:25:58.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不许动  举起手来  放在我们能看到的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it!Hands up where we can see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.96,0:26:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说我的表演害死人了 他们还说\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said my acting was killing people,they said that
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.25,0:26:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我施的是真魔法  说我是用塔罗牌施咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was using real magic,that I was casting spells on tarot cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.68,0:26:16.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"真魔法"  那些家伙是蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Rreal magic." Those guys are nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.94,0:26:19.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的好运气让你死里逃生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.49,0:26:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会认为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.27,0:26:24.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.45,0:26:26.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  我现在能做到的事...那些纸牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,the things that I can do now -- the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.62,0:26:29.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一生都以摆弄那些纸牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been working the cards your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.49,0:26:30.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  那次逃脱怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,what about the escapes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.84,0:26:33.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这30年都不曾从自己的袖子里逃脱过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't been able to slip a pair of cuffs in 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.73,0:26:36.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且就是以那样的方式 帕特里克 万斯死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then there was the way that -- that Patrick Vance died
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.43,0:26:37.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有那个杰布 德克斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that Jeb Dexter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.93,0:26:39.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  没什么大不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,no great loss there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.32,0:26:40.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  查理  他不该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,Charlie,he didn't deserve to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.95,0:26:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你与这一切都无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.45,0:26:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就在同一晚上吊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was hanged the same night
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.95,0:26:45.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我表演刽子手的那一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I performed the executioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.42,0:26:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.80,0:26:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是在说实际上你相信那些人的话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you telling me that you actually believe those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.83,0:26:52.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信有所谓"真魔法"存在吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there was some kind of "real magic" involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.32,0:26:53.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.49,0:26:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.78,0:26:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  也许有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know,maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.51,0:27:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我不该再继续了  查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't go on tonight,Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.63,0:27:04.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.99,0:27:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在上座率百分之百\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a sold-out house out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.89,0:27:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,百分之百\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sold out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.47,0:27:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你上一次上座率百分之百是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time that happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.76,0:27:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有那一晚...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other night...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.82,0:27:21.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我挑战"死亡魔术"的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was doing the table of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.27,0:27:24.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was,um...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.28,0:27:30.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾想要自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I was gonna kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.12,0:27:33.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道自己如何逃脱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have no idea how I got out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.34,0:27:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.93,0:27:42.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow,you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.62,0:27:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jay...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.78,0:27:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你的时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you were in your day
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.67,0:27:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你曾是无所不能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.59,0:27:54.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"无所不能的大JJ"  你是我见过最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The incredible Jay."You were the best I ever saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.40,0:27:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你的状态又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you got it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.54,0:28:00.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道怎么回事  但那都无所谓  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how,but it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.30,0:28:04.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要能再看到你回到巅峰时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to see you at the top of your game again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.93,0:28:07.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  让我觉得自己又回到年轻的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell,it makes me feel young.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.33,0:28:09.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但是  -没有但是 杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But - No buts,Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.49,0:28:13.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也许是来自上天的恩赐  我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may be maa from heaven,I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.72,0:28:16.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是不管它是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but whatever it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.25,0:28:19.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都不要放弃它\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't throw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.22,0:29:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.52,0:29:41.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢打电话通知我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for dropping the charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.85,0:29:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不介意告诉我你为什么要这么做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind telling us why you did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.09,0:29:47.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得谈谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.38,0:29:54.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们第一次相遇的时候我还只是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just a kid when we first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.31,0:29:56.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我所掌握的只是出老千\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know was how to cheat at cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.81,0:29:59.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数不清有多少次查理帮我解围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie got me out of more scrapes than I can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.92,0:30:05.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  我20岁的时候就该死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell,I would have been dead by the age of 20
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.15,0:30:07.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是遇到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it hadn't been for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.79,0:30:12.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不只是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was more than my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.77,0:30:14.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.21,0:30:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾 杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry,Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.07,0:30:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看  我真应该听你们的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,I should have listened to you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.96,0:30:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你们告诉我我的表演害死人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you told me that my show was killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.51,0:30:25.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是那个扣动扳机的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,you weren't the one pulling the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.49,0:30:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  但是有人做了  我要找出是谁这样对待查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,but someone did,and I want to find out who did this to Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.70,0:30:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我会照你们说的做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'll do whatever you guys say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.10,0:30:32.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要告诉我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.66,0:30:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊 不管是谁做的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jay,whoever's doing this...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.18,0:30:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是喜欢你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.18,0:30:40.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能是你亲密的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're probably close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.72,0:30:44.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理与佛农相处的融洽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Charlie and Vernon get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:46.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.47,0:30:48.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不会是佛农\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,it's not vernon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.25,0:30:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是唯一说得通的解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the only one that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.86,0:30:55.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理与佛农是你的家人 杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie and Vernon were your family,Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.09,0:30:56.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在查理死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now Charlie's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.76,0:31:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但是...他们有时争锋相对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,but...they butted heads sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.41,0:31:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是佛农绝不会做这样的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Vernon could never do something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.39,0:31:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看  关于真魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}See,the thing about real magic
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.13,0:31:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是一次尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a whole lot like crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.94,0:31:13.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们尝到甜头就会做出让人吃惊的事来\N{\fnArial\fs30}People do surprising things once they get a taste of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.31,0:31:19.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好他妈的确定这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better be damn sure about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.96,0:31:23.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,佛农是我唯一的依靠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vernon's all I got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.99,0:31:33.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.63,0:31:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.75,0:31:40.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一会儿就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there in two shakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.76,0:31:42.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样我有些事要告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something to tell you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.47,0:32:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔  这就像个魔术博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.It's like a...magic museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.76,0:32:11.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定会上天堂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.07,0:32:13.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙不是轻装上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy doesn't travel light.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.09,0:32:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一生总是漂泊不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been on the road his whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.99,0:32:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他所拥有的一切都在这屋里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably everything he owns is in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.23,0:32:18.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.71,0:32:33.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和协会的人探讨过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just talked to the head of the convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.68,0:32:35.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,压轴演出的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Headliner gig is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.38,0:32:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.83,0:32:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.34,0:32:47.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一天之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}A day ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.17,0:32:49.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你告诉我将会站在这个舞台上...\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you told me I'd be standing on this stage...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.91,0:32:54.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我做不到 佛农\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I can't do it,Vernon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.49,0:32:56.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.07,0:32:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查利死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.41,0:33:01.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查利在天之灵  希望你继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie would have wanted you to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.11,0:33:02.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.86,0:33:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.71,0:33:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.83,0:33:09.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是查利所希望的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what charlie would have wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.01,0:33:12.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.68,0:33:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  他也是我的挚友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,he was my friend,too,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.80,0:33:20.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样对待朋友  太卑鄙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a hell of a way to treat a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.11,0:33:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又在说什么胡话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again,what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.73,0:33:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了他  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed him,didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.83,0:33:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.45,0:33:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我...我们可以东山再起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that I --so that we could be back on top?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.67,0:33:31.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胡言乱语\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.07,0:33:33.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你吓着我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,you're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.57,0:33:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先是万斯  然后是杰布·德克斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}First it was vance,then it was jeb dexter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.66,0:33:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便你是为了我  才这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you thought you were doing it for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.74,0:33:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你怎可以杀害查利\N{\fnArial\fs30}How in god's name could you kill charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.54,0:33:44.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,you are crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.09,0:33:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你利用我  利用我的魔术杀害他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used me,and you used my act to do this to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.09,0:33:51.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊 我不会如此责难他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be so hard on him,jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.36,0:33:54.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.11,0:33:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽是些过气魔术道具\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just a bunch of old-timey magic stuff --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.88,0:34:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点用都没\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of it magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.80,0:34:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有香草  没有蜡烛  没有塔罗牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}No herbs,no candles,and no tarot cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.22,0:34:09.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要怪我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.78,0:34:11.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.01,0:34:14.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还认得他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look like anyone we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.15,0:34:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet mary and joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.41,0:34:25.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.03,0:34:33.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊 真的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really me,jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.23,0:34:36.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么鬼东西...\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.62,0:34:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你忘了年轻的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}God,you forget what it feels like to be young.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.14,0:34:41.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.04,0:34:43.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你多大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.29,0:34:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那要看你是怎么定义"年龄"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,it depends on what you mean by "old."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.41,0:34:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,严格来说  我现在28岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now,technically,about 28,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.60,0:34:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但其实我来这里有一段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've been around a lot longer than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.73,0:34:52.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.60,0:34:54.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我有只够时间说服一个巫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough to have shilled for barnum.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.28,0:34:56.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我某样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he gave me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.82,0:34:57.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.71,0:35:00.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,秘法书  载有真正魔法的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grimoire --a book of real magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.72,0:35:02.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始  我还以为是骗人的把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first,I thought it was a scam,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.27,0:35:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来  我试用上面的咒语  还凑效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I tried one of the spells,and it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.56,0:35:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  咒语都当真不假\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact,they all worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.51,0:35:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我翻到最后一页  记载了一个永生的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when I got to the end and there was one for immortality...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.17,0:35:11.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  查利\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god,charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.43,0:35:14.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在表演上  我所表演的戏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my show,the things that I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.48,0:35:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不同的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Different spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.01,0:35:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你品尝一下万能的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it gives you a little taste of what's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.98,0:35:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不建议你碰那个  弗农\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,no,i wouldn't touch those,vernon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.22,0:35:26.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们还散发着魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're --they're still radioactive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.13,0:35:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了万斯和杰布·德克斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed vance and jeb dexter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.48,0:35:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  难道你以为这是室内游戏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,you think this is a parlor game?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.34,0:35:35.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些混蛋整天挖苦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were being humiliated by those punks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.94,0:35:39.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个过气糟老头无力反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A washed-up old man who couldn't even defend himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.41,0:35:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你利用我做如此可怖之事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used me to do these terrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.76,0:35:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用咒语  送你厚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used them to give you a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.91,0:35:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不也沾沾自喜吗  你的眼睛出卖了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wanted it,jay. I saw it in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.89,0:35:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有那样想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,i never wanted this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.33,0:35:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都准备自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were ready to kill yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.02,0:35:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拯救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.26,0:35:56.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right,jay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.89,0:35:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在你身边  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there for you,like I've always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.56,0:36:04.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I'll always be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.77,0:36:06.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩  跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me,both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.83,0:36:08.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为第一轮精彩绝伦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the first time around was good?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.71,0:36:09.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二轮才是顶峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second time's even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.97,0:36:12.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经知道怎么操作  驾轻就熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the know-how,none of the aches and pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.74,0:36:17.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  别  我不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,i won't do this.I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.43,0:36:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前  我可没开出这样的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never made this offer before.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.91,0:36:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为  以前我没想过会交到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,then again,I've never had friends
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.87,0:36:23.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两你们两人的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the two of you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.82,0:36:25.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me do this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.66,0:36:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了我们永生  还有谁需要牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who else has to die so that we can live forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.11,0:36:34.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了永生  究竟要付出多大代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the price tag on immortality?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.13,0:36:35.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你所做的一切  都是错的  查利\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't right,charlie,what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.97,0:36:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你清楚得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.75,0:36:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从心底里  你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere,you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.22,0:36:41.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我不要孤独一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I don't want to come back alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.97,0:36:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}To start all over,alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.43,0:36:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jay...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.53,0:36:49.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时光可以倒流\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can be young again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.39,0:36:52.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们三人  青春健壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}The three of us together --vital and alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.82,0:36:54.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永生不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.74,0:36:56.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.35,0:36:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是贵族  这也不是什么神奇之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't guttenberg,and this ain't "cocoon."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.55,0:37:11.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永生  好把戏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immortality. that's a neat trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.57,0:37:15.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是把戏  是魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a trick.it's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.01,0:37:23.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快接子弹  我练了好久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,bullet catch --been working on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.76,0:37:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.04,0:37:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放了他  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go -- now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.67,0:37:34.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离我和我朋友远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave me and my friends alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.59,0:37:38.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放弃试用咒语和魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,i will give it up --the spells,the hexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.27,0:37:40.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保证  这是最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the last time.I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.51,0:38:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jay...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.88,0:38:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然帮着外人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picked these strangers over me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.76,0:39:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.32,0:39:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.07,0:39:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,i'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.92,0:39:44.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.31,0:39:48.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想说声感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanted to thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.71,0:39:51.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  昨天救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what you did yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.20,0:39:54.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天  我杀了我的挚友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed my best friend yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.58,0:39:56.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want to thank me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.95,0:40:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗农呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's vernon?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.38,0:40:05.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.36,0:40:07.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我对查利所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he didn't want to speak to me again
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.36,0:40:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他再也不想跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}after what i did to charlie
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.36,0:40:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰  你知道  查利永远不会放弃做他想做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}listen jay,you know,charlie is never gonna give up on what he's doing
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.65,0:40:18.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永不\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.36,0:40:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}you did the right thing
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.50,0:40:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you sure about that
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.50,0:40:24.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查利犹如我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know charlie was just like me brother
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.50,0:40:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今  他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now,he's dead
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.50,0:40:29.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我做了对的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}because i did the right thing
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.50,0:40:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他送赠我一份厚礼  我却以怨报德\N{\fnArial\fs30}he offer me the a gift that i just threw it back to his face
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.50,0:40:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我终究孤独终老\N{\fnArial\fs30}so now i have to spend the rest of my life old and alone
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.50,0:40:48.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟有哪点对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's right about that
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.50,0:40:55.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}jay
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.50,0:40:57.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的卡片\N{\fnArial\fs30}your cards
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.50,0:41:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}leave them away
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.50,0:41:16.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你怎么想  我现在想喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}i don't know about you buddy,i can go for a beer
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.50,0:41:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要出去走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}i gonna take a walk
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.50,0:41:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay,i'm in
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.50,0:41:51.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}what changes your mind
